## Learning Outcome

Through this project, I learned:

* How large numbers are handled internally
* Implementation of arithmetic logic from scratch
* Use of vectors for dynamic storage
* Handling edge cases like carry and leading zeros

---

## Limitations

* Supports only non-negative integers
* Limited operations (no division/subtraction yet)

---

## Future Improvements

* Add subtraction and division
* Support negative numbers
* Operator overloading (+, *, etc.)
